          "Caption": "Person Responsible",
          "Category": null,
          "DefaultValue": null,
          "Description": "Person responsible for this facility. This person will be responsible for ensuring suppliers' details are up to date and completes evaluations along with many child workflow activities such as certification and documentation requirements.",
