        "LocalizationData": {
          "$id": "8329",
          "Caption": {
            "$id": "8330",
            "fr": "Exigences relatives aux documents",
            "de": "Anforderungen an die Dokumentation",
            "en-US": "Documentation Requirements",
            "zh": "文件要求",
            "pt": "Requisitos de documentação",
            "es": "Requisitos de documentación"
          },
          "Description": {
            "$id": "8331",
            "fr": "Les deux sociétés mères fournisseur et installations peuvent avoir des exigences relatives aux documents qui leur sont rattachés, d'où la relation est faite pour le fournisseur abstraite.",
            "de": "Sowohl Lieferanten Muttergesellschaften und Einrichtungen können Dokumentationspflichten zu ihnen angebracht, damit die Beziehung erfolgt an den Lieferanten abstrakte.",
            "en-US": "Both supplier parent companies and facilities can have documentation requirements attached to them, hence the relation is being made to the supplier abstract.",
            "zh": "两个供应商的母公司和设施可以有文件要求附加到他们，因此关系正在向供应商抽象。",
            "pt": "Tanto fornecedor empresas-mãe e instalações podem ter requisitos de documentação que lhes são inerentes, portanto, a relação está sendo feita ao fornecedor abstrata.",
            "es": "Ambas empresas de padre proveedor y servicios pueden tener requisitos de documentación adjunto a ellos, por lo tanto, la relación se está haciendo al proveedor Resumen."
          },
          "Hint": {
            "$id": "8332",
            "fr": "",
            "de": "",
            "en-US": "",
            "zh": "",
            "pt": "",
            "es": ""
          },
